<tr><td><b>Acne mechanica</b> vs <b>cosmetica</b> vs <b>occupational</b></td><td><span class="ln">Mechanica: occlusion or irritation of the skin.</span><span class="ln">Cosmetica: comedogenic oils in cosmetics.</span><span class="ln">Occupational: dirt, vaporized cooking oil, industrial chemicals.</span></td><td>A helmet or strap called cosmetica.</td><td>35</td></tr>
