<tr><td><b>CBG</b> vs <b>Hsp90</b></td><td>CBG carries the steroid in the blood. Hsp90 chaperones the receptor in the cell and comes off when the steroid binds.</td><td>Hsp90 as the carrier protein.</td><td>10</td></tr>
